Third-party components (NOT redistributed by this repository; the installer
downloads or installs them from their own sources):

- Voxtype (https://github.com/peteonrails/voxtype) — MIT License.
  Binaries are downloaded from its GitHub releases by install.sh /
  update-voxtype.sh.

- dotool (https://git.sr.ht/~geb/dotool) — GPL-3.0. Installed as a system
  package (Fedora COPR, Arch, or built from source by the user).

- NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 speech model — CC-BY-4.0. Downloaded by
  `voxtype setup --download --model parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-int8`.

The voice model and the two Voxtype binaries keep their own licenses; this
repository only contains the GNOME Shell extension, the installer scripts and
the configuration template.
